  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Crackers_Wither_Storm_Performance/BH_CWSP_header.webp\" alt=\"橫幅標頭\">\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftinyurl.com%252famy67484\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Crackers_Wither_Storm_Performance/BH_CWSP_promo.webp\" alt=\"Bisecthosting 宣傳橫幅\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Crackers_Wither_Storm_Performance/BH_CWSP_overview.webp\" alt=\"總覽橫幅\"></h2>\n<p><strong>Cracker's Wither Storm Performance</strong> 是一款以效能為核心的整合包，圍繞著「凋靈風暴」模組打造。旨在讓玩家能盡情享受精彩的頭目戰，而無需擔心效能問題。想要追求視覺享受？在對抗這隻超過 100 個方塊體積的怪物時，依然可以暢享您喜愛的材質特效（Shaders）！</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/crackers-wither-storm-performance\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmodpack%252fcrackers-wither-storm-performance\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fkesselot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/kofi-plural-alt_vector.svg\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a></p>\n<h1>特色</h1>\n<ul>\n<li>[✔️] <strong>完全最佳化</strong> - 開箱即用，完美支援材質特效（Shaders）。</li>\n<li>[✔️] <strong>Cracker's Wither Storm</strong> - 擁有龐大方塊體積的怪物！隨時準備迎戰。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/N8tUm6N4Qc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Crackers_Wither_Storm_Performance/BH_CWSP_discord.webp\" alt=\"Discord 橫幅\"></a></p>\n<h3>整合包注意事項</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>如果您是遊玩此整合包的 YouTube 創作者或內容製作人，請在影片描述中附上連結導回本頁面，以便其他人知道您使用的整合包。</strong></li>\n<li><strong>不允許在 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 上重新上傳此整合包或任何修改版本，此規定同樣適用於重新分發至其他網站。</strong>（<em>除非獲得本人明確授權</em>）</li>\n</ul>",
